    {
      "id": "claim_6fdb1a6569054192af6db5ccab257f96",
      "statement": "ChatCacheParameter.parameters() joins model name and seed with '_' and omits the temperature component when it is 0.0 (e.g. gpt-4o_42 vs gpt-4o_42_0.5) — the LiSSA file-name compatibility rule, since CacheManager composes the LocalCache file name from the origin class name plus parameters() as <Origin>_<parameters>.json and unconditionally appending 0.0 would rename existing temperature-0.0 cache files.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/edu/kit/kastel/mcse/ardoco/llm/cache/CacheManager.java#L202-L208",
