      "statement": "ChatCacheKey carries model, seed, temperature, CHAT mode, content, and a localKey; instances are created only through the package-private ChatCacheKey.of (the constructor is private), which pins the mode to LargeLanguageModelCacheMode.CHAT and derives localKey from KeyGenerator.generateKey(content); localKey is @JsonIgnore'd out of toJsonKey() but is included in equals/hashCode.",
