      "id": "claim_1a88fc72a93f43d6a6f01ffe826bd569",
      "statement": "EmbeddingCacheKey.of pins seed and temperature to -1 and the mode to EMBEDDING; the -1 values carry no information (embeddings have no seed/temperature) and exist purely as backward-compatibility markers, and the serialized JSON key contains EMBEDDING but not the localKey.",
