      "id": "claim_5a2a6c83937a4d0c8fd2618c7dfb2ac4",
      "statement": "The deprecated EmbeddingCacheKey.ofRaw(model, content, localKey) exists only for keys with a custom local key; its single production call site is CachedEmbeddingCreator.tryToFixWithLength, which addresses the truncated-prefix recovery entry under the custom local key <original localKey>_fixed_8000 with content \"(FIXED::8000): …\" through the equally deprecated Cache.getViaInternalKey, and EmbeddingCacheKeyTest.ofRawCustomLocalKey guards that the custom local key is preserved.",
